{"ID":"20251114112150-ledl594","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251114112150-ledl594","title":"UPL9-17-a——多个入口函数","type":"doc","updated":"20251114160322"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114113747-b4821f0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251114113747-b4821f0","updated":"20251114160322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20251114113751-4ueqg7t","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251114113751-4ueqg7t","updated":"20251114160322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#pragma kernel\t\t// 通过 #pragma kernel 声明入口函数，可以有多个（请注意在 #pragma kernel 指令的同一行上不允许 \"// text\" 样式的注释）\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251114112150-d6zgnvb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251114112150-d6zgnvb","updated":"20251114112326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多个入口函数的含义"}]},{"ID":"20251114112238-cz6gdn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114112238-cz6gdn1","updated":"20251114112256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个 Compute Shader 文件可以定义多个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Kernel"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（内核），即多个入口函数\n每个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Kernel"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（内核）入口函数可以有独立的线程数量配置\n我们在 CPU 端（C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 侧）需要为每个入口函数单独调用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Dispatch()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251114112238-s16cz9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114112238-s16cz9k","updated":"20251114112314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本原理：我们每声明一个入口函数，都会被编译为一个独立的 内核（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Kernel"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​），相当于 GPU 上的一个可单独调用的计算程序"}]},{"ID":"20251114112326-b21r97o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251114112326-b21r97o","name":"#pragma kernel","updated":"20251114113556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多个入口函数声明和使用方式"}]},{"ID":"20251114112332-u3me5i6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114112332-u3me5i6","updated":"20251114113530"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114112517-p1cvyyo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114112517-p1cvyyo","updated":"20251114113018"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114112517-foqjxko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114112517-foqjxko","updated":"20251114112733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Compute Shader 中使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"#pragma kernel"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 定义多个内核入口函数"}]},{"ID":"20251114112529-hvg7ius","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251114112529-hvg7ius","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251114112533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251114112556-grn2bte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114112556-grn2bte","updated":"20251114112556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："}]},{"ID":"20251114112533-703sodg","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114112533-703sodg","updated":"20251114112533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114112533-s7pwfx7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114112533-s7pwfx7","updated":"20251114112533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114112533-ges53n8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114112533-ges53n8","updated":"20251114112551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入口函数不能重名（在一个 Compute Shader 文件中）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114112533-8hbc1zv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251114112533-8hbc1zv","updated":"20251114112533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114112533-xdrnqxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114112533-xdrnqxj","updated":"20251114112713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入口函数可以共享该 Compute Shader 中声明的变量"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251114112713-5lifu8h","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251114112713-5lifu8h","updated":"20251114113018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 通过 #pragma kernel 声明入口函数，可以有多个\n#pragma kernel CSMain\n#pragma kernel CSMain2\n\n// 所有入口函数共享的变量\nRWTexture2D\u003cfloat4\u003e Result;\nfloat f;\n\n[numthreads(8,8,1)]\nvoid CSMain (uint3 id : SV_DispatchThreadID)\n{\n    // 书写核心计算逻辑\n    Result[id.xy] = float4(id.x \u0026 id.y, (id.x \u0026 15)/15.0, (id.y \u0026 15)/15.0, 0.0);\n}\n\n[numthreads(8, 8, 1)]\nvoid CSMain2 (uint3 id : SV_DispatchThreadID)\n{\n    // 书写核心计算逻辑\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114112517-sugu8tm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251114112517-sugu8tm","updated":"20251114113530"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114112517-bbuh6zt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114112517-bbuh6zt","updated":"20251114113152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 CPU（C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 侧）调用时，需要获取对应入口索引"}]},{"ID":"20251114113151-16qqmds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113151-16qqmds","updated":"20251114113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过多个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Dispatch()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 函数进行调用，用索引进行区分，使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251114110018-eo9mztw","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"FindKernel()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 传入入口函数名即可获取索引"}]},{"ID":"20251114112607-xpeymf5","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251114112607-xpeymf5","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251114113403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251114112611-kxyu1po","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114112611-kxyu1po","updated":"20251114113403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Dispatch()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 函数的调用类似异步，不会对 CPU 造成阻塞\n只是提交执行指令给到 GPU，GPU 侧会按照 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Dispatch()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 顺序，依次执行内核入口函数\n即"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"在一个"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Dispatch()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"内部，GPU 执行是并行的；多个"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Dispatch()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"调用之间，是串行的，需要按顺序执行"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114112653-7si9obp","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251114112653-7si9obp","updated":"20251114113530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"public ComputeShader computeShader;     // 声明 computeShader 变量，可以通过 Inspector 窗口关联，也可以动态加载\n\nvoid Start()\n{\n    int index = computeShader.FindKernel(\"CSMain\");     // 获取 computeShader 中名为 CSMain 的函数索引\n    int index2 = computeShader.FindKernel(\"CSMain2\");   // 获取 computeShader 中名为 CSMain2 的函数索引\n    computeShader.SetFloat(\"f\", 10.0f);                 // 传递相关参数\n    computeShader.Dispatch(index, 64, 64, 0);           // 启动 CSMain 的计算\n    computeShader.Dispatch(index2, 64, 64, 0);          // 启动 CSMain2 的计算，它会在 CSMain 计算完成后执行\n    // 使用GPU计算完成输出的数据渲染或者传回CPU\n    // 释放资源\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251114113555-ldfo6sk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251114113555-ldfo6sk","updated":"20251114113735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多个入口函数对于我们的意义"}]},{"ID":"20251114113604-941n2k8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114113604-941n2k8","updated":"20251114113715"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114113617-9uxzwrl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114113617-9uxzwrl","updated":"20251114113617"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114113617-r9t7ab5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113617-r9t7ab5","updated":"20251114113617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分阶段执行"}]},{"ID":"20251114113617-2m9ua1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113617-2m9ua1z","updated":"20251114113637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们可以将部分计算逻辑分步执行，分阶段处理，我们可以利用多入口函数串行执行的这一特点。实现出类似流水线一样的分布执行，比如："}]},{"ID":"20251114113629-e97mz0k","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114113629-e97mz0k","updated":"20251114113629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114113629-mswtgew","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114113629-mswtgew","updated":"20251114113629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114113629-m3ficy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113629-m3ficy6","updated":"20251114113629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初始化阶段"}]},{"ID":"20251114113630-69w1aem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113630-69w1aem","updated":"20251114113630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在第一个内核入口函数中分配、填充初始数据"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114113629-04anrel","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251114113629-04anrel","updated":"20251114113629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114113629-z4gbtjf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113629-z4gbtjf","updated":"20251114113629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模拟阶段"}]},{"ID":"20251114113631-305vh65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113631-305vh65","updated":"20251114113631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在第二个内核入口函数中更新位置、速度等数据"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114113629-ogthiop","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251114113629-ogthiop","updated":"20251114113629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114113629-icr215z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113629-icr215z","updated":"20251114113629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"渲染阶段"}]},{"ID":"20251114113632-9nio26t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113632-9nio26t","updated":"20251114113632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在第三个内核入口函数中把结果写入纹理"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251114113617-qrmbnwk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251114113617-qrmbnwk","updated":"20251114113617"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114113617-c90t3ow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113617-c90t3ow","updated":"20251114113617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"逻辑模块化"}]},{"ID":"20251114113642-avks5ep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113642-avks5ep","updated":"20251114113644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们可以让不同的内核入口函数负责不同的功能，这样从设计上更加清晰易维护"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114113617-hil0hm2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251114113617-hil0hm2","updated":"20251114113617"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114113617-id7uxs3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113617-id7uxs3","updated":"20251114113617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同任务可以使用不同线程组配置"}]},{"ID":"20251114113647-ylz6lqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113647-ylz6lqc","updated":"20251114113647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同内核入口函数的线程组配置可以不同\n可以针对性的设置线程组配置"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114113617-7361ukp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251114113617-7361ukp","updated":"20251114113617"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114113617-u7z2nqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113617-u7z2nqv","updated":"20251114113658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少 ComputeShader 文件数量"}]},{"ID":"20251114113659-9mu85se","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113659-9mu85se","updated":"20251114113707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在一个 ComputeShader 文件中可以包含多个内核入口函数\nCPU（C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 侧）只需要加载一次 ComputeShader 文件，就可以执行多个内核入口函数"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114113617-y3n9z4g","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251114113617-y3n9z4g","updated":"20251114113715"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114113617-qd0t64s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113617-qd0t64s","updated":"20251114113617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"共享数据"}]},{"ID":"20251114113709-o90in8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113709-o90in8h","updated":"20251114113715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多个内核入口函数由于在一个 ComputeShader 文件中，因此他们可以共享数据"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251114113604-bl8zwg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113604-bl8zwg7","updated":"20251114113735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总结：多入口函数相当于 GPU 并行计算的多阶段流水线，\n它让我们可以把复杂 GPU 计算流程拆解成多个独立、可组合的模块，提高性能、可读性和可维护性"}]}]}